// Title: All command lines (for review)
// Size: large
// Why: The full list with parent and account, for patterns no rule anticipates. Sort by creation time to follow a session; filter on the grid for "\Users\", "http", "-enc", "\\\\" or a hostname.
ProcTree()
| where InPslist and isnotempty(CommandLine)
| project CreateTime, PID, Process = Name, Parent = ParentName, UserSid, SessionId, CommandLine
| order by CreateTime asc
